# Store every text file with LF in the repository.
#
# Without this, Windows editors and tooling silently rewrite whole files to
# CRLF. That is not cosmetic here: release gates hash tracked text
# (docs/legal/dependency-notices.lock.json, the community backend manifest) and
# tools/foss_reproducibility_check.py diffs git-tracked inputs across two
# checkouts, so a line-ending flip changes a digest without changing a line of
# code. Fourteen tracked files had mixed line endings before this file existed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows batch must keep CRLF or cmd.exe can mis-parse continuation lines.
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Binary payloads: never convert, never diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
*.jar binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
*.pdf binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
